*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Raw datasets and coursework source material
Data/
*.csv
*.txt
!requirements.txt
*.pdf
feedback.md
*:Zone.Identifier

# Trained models and large generated artefacts
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
