# Ignore generated results, but publish the Markdown reports and the image
# assets required for them to render correctly on GitHub/the website.
results/*
!results/docs/
results/docs/*
!results/docs/*.md
!results/docs/assets/
results/docs/assets/*
!results/docs/assets/*.png

# Operating-system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
